@MyApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5186

GET {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### --- Rediseño fase 1 y 2 ---
# Token de admin: POST {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login y pega el token aquí
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN

### Canchas ya usadas (autocompletar)
GET {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/matches/venues

### Crear partido con cancha
POST {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "matchDate": "2026-10-29T20:00:00", "homeTeamId": 1, "awayTeamId": 2, "venue": "Cancha La Paz, Envigado" }

### Cambiar (o borrar con "") la cancha
PUT {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/matches/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "venue": "" }

### Apodo del jugador
PUT {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/players/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "German", "lastName": "Piña", "nickname": "El Profe", "idPosition": 4 }

### Posiciones compartidas (x/y en %; null = ubicación automática)
PUT {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/matchplayers/2/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[ { "playerId": 4, "x": 30, "y": 40 }, { "playerId": 12, "x": null, "y": null } ]

### Pasar a un jugador al otro equipo (vuelve a ubicación automática)
PATCH {{MyApi_HostAddress}}/api/matchplayers/2/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "teamId": 2 }
